  <item>
    <title>92.全民进入过日子的时代，体面和优雅还重要吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac8c5b1195d838e2aef4fa4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac8c5b1195d838e2aef4fa4</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 09 Oct 2026 10:55:22 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>在北京最舒服的金秋，和晓雪姐在北京坊pageone，借由她重新修订的《优雅是种力量》聊开去。我们聊时尚，聊优雅，聊与年龄的相爱相杀，聊中年人的困惑与解法......</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a> 为什么是修订，而不是写一本新书？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">03:43</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="432">07:12</a> 从《穿普拉达的女王》到《早春晴朗》：时尚是时代的风向标</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a> 时装不只是时装，时尚是一个轮回</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="619">10:19</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a> 优雅从“遥不可及”到“深深受益”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="884">14:44</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a> 普通女孩与优雅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1024">17:04</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 什么绝对不是优雅？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 慈悲与跳脱：把眼光往别人身上放一放</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a> 这个时代为什么更需要优雅和体面？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1434">23:54</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> 你身边的人是你自己筛选出来的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a> 人生重要选择：先问自己最想要什么，才知道要放弃什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1886">31:26</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a> 你想要的任何新东西，另一面都是放弃</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2073">34:33</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a> 中年可能性会收窄，但纵深挖掘的力量会变强</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2262">37:42</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> 把岁月当闺蜜，不当敌人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3169">52:49</a> 优雅是看到别人的辛苦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3169">52:49</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3477">57:57</a> 经济下行时代，普通女孩如何践行优雅？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3477">57:57</a>–结束 现场互动</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63132c2223d10ae8a17947b4/liUFGjOahuIO7R-_OTMTmT9-_T0F.m4a" length="90677935" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:33:21</itunes:duration>
