  <item>
    <title>91.见好其实就是一种心动的能力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ab24614f04646b3a9556f13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ab24614f04646b3a9556f13</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Sep 2026 09:23:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 见闪电掠空而不觉一场空</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="347">05:47</a> 有天命的人：很早就知道自己要写字</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="556">09:16</a> 掩体：艺术、自然、爱，抵御生活向下的曲线</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1016">16:56</a> 好是发现的还是创造的？关于“赋魅”的能力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1329">22:09</a> 编剧的秘密：中年回望青春，才拍得好青春片</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 见好就是一种心动的能力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1721">28:41</a> 一个绝对能心动的人：康普茶、管风琴、隶书</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2093">34:53</a> 八岁那本被烧掉的武侠小说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2383">39:43</a> 写作像恋爱：包办婚姻二十年，终于自由恋爱</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2817">46:57</a> 被鲸鱼生吞：写《有点福气》的至暗与狂喜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> 心动是需要付出代价的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 带一本心爱的书，去见生命中最重要的人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5095">01:24:55</a> 心动的方式：一见钟情与生理性喜欢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5359">01:29:19</a> 人生下半场是织锦的背面</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5502">01:31:42</a> 生机勃勃的秘密：顺应天性、习惯塑造、立刻行动</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6050">01:40:50</a> 生能量与死能量</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6396">01:46:36</a> 悲观，但兴致勃勃</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63132c2223d10ae8a17947b4/lriJTGvV87urgyG_VHWWzSERdK1b.m4a" length="108502709" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:51:42</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmUDzgJGvDy8Y3b8kkbRhU4mYN_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>91</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
