  <item>
    <title>87.春天就应该散漫自由的读书呀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69f3192b038707a771977147</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69f3192b038707a771977147</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 01 May 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>认同马伯庸：稳定输出靠大量输入</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a>用好书开启好心情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="205">03:25</a> 推荐漫画《故止浮生》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="430">07:10</a>在小红书重读亦舒、蔡澜、李娟、沈从文、汪曾祺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a>推荐《故止浮生》，好书自有生命力</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a>病中与低谷的救命书：汪曾祺、老舍、李一冰《苏东坡新传》、何大草《金桃》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a>推荐《加达拉的神迹》，一本看了就不想死的书</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 女性主义写作，重新看见历史中被忽略的女性</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> 小说《黄油》，以木村佳苗案为原型，食物、身体、女性觉醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3660">61:00</a>女性叙事不再以爱情 、性缘为核心，重视女性情谊与自我</span></p><p></p><p><span>本期书单</span></p><p><span>漫画</span></p><p><span>《故止浮生》｜儿岛青</span></p><p><span>《东京平常日》《卢浮宫的猫》｜松本大洋</span></p><p><span>《大奥》｜吉永史</span></p><p><span>小说 </span></p><p><span>《加达拉的奇迹》| 中岛门罗</span></p><p><span>《黄油》|柚木麻子</span></p><p><span>《模仿犯》《怪》｜宫部美雪</span></p><p><span>《厨房》《下北泽》｜吉本芭娜娜</span></p><p><span>救命书单（低谷必看）</span></p><p><span>汪曾祺</span></p><p><span>老舍</span></p><p><span>李一冰《苏东坡新传》</span></p><p><span>何大草《金桃》</span></p><p></p><p><span>音乐选取：</span></p><p><span>《My dear weirdo》——昨夜派对</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
