  <item>
    <title>86.《有点福气》里，藏着我们对生活的全部热爱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e76f0f1e94ae6921cf9e92</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e76f0f1e94ae6921cf9e92</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>邀请好友佳纯，对谈已写到46 万字的言情小说《有点福气》创作全程。两人回忆乌镇戏剧节的乌托邦时光，被《人类之城马拉松》震撼，畅谈理想主义；揭秘小说人物设定、福州烟火气与大量实地采访细节，分享从编剧到写小说的创作挣扎、自我和解，以及最终回归日常的平实结局。故事有甜有苦，有烟火有理想。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="143">02:23</a> 乌镇戏剧节，沉浸式乌托邦体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="275">04:35</a> 为《人类之城马拉松》两次改机票、延住酒店，被顶级戏剧震撼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="631">10:31</a> 深夜火锅，与老师聊理想主义与风骨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="737">12:17</a> 年度最美好瞬间</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a> 女主许多福人设立得住，职场线扎实动人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 十万字时焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1161">19:21</a> 空心菜、肉燕、葱肉饼等美食唤醒感官与乡愁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 不追求传奇开挂，写平常人珍贵的懂得与联结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a> 北京返乡纪录片导演，理想主义与职场幻灭</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2244">37:24</a> 福州是隐形主角，充满烟火与人文气质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2599">43:19</a> 人设突破，选择有冒犯感、有血性的男主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2815">46:55</a> 沉溺细节、篇幅超长，自我批判与自我接纳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2922">48:42</a> 山不让尘，水不辞盈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> 写小说是用情感打通世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3196">53:16</a> 剧本靠技巧，小说靠生命能量，孤独且耗心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3427">57:07</a> 电影感 + 漫画感，蒙太奇与定格画面兼具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4042">01:07:22</a> 好故事像灯，相信故事的治愈与力量</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐选取</span></p><span></span><p><span>《亚麻质地的少女》-温格华生</span><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63132c2223d10ae8a17947b4/lsUm6ms8x3u9SbN91RyY26Tx97MR.m4a" length="68353414" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:10:22</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmUDzgJGvDy8Y3b8kkbRhU4mYN_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>86</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>85.比喻一开始，爱情就开始了，错觉也开始了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e229ba1e94ae6921806e2e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e229ba1e94ae6921806e2e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 17 Apr 2026 12:44:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是年前在福州与两位好友大伯、三姨的对谈，我们从学生时代的事与愿违，聊到人生选择的遗憾，从奇葩说的台前幕后聊到最后回归写作，坦诚分享那些求而不得、期待落空的时刻。也真诚向大家推荐他们的播客——</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61da998b706d9f90d73e21a5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/61da998b706d9f90d73e21a5"><span>《大伯和三姨》</span></a><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="123">02:03</a> 学生时代的事与愿违</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="336">05:36</a> 与福州深度联结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="386">06:26</a> 参加《奇葩说》的原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="489">08:09</a> 团队很珍贵，彼此支持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="715">11:55</a> 激流勇退，把屁股放在凳子上</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 表达欲越来越减退</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1446">24:06</a> 最大的事与愿违</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a> “二手性学家” 是自我选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2252">37:32</a> 被喜欢是投射，“不感兴趣的感兴趣” 很伤人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2619">43:39</a> 爱情本质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2949">49:09</a> 时代的事与愿违</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3492">58:12</a> 尽量保持年轻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3680">1:01:20</a> 新书《有点福气》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3920">1:05:20</a> 把成功标准从外求转为内求，感动具体的人就足够</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4289">1:11:29</a> 事与愿违不可怕，总有一天能笑着谈起</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63132c2223d10ae8a17947b4/lvFPyU7wzRxzHwBBxbIzAk5Am2Bk.m4a" length="72035069" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:14:09</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmUDzgJGvDy8Y3b8kkbRhU4mYN_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>85</itunes:episode>
