  <item>
    <title>83.很悲观，但对具体的生活有兴致</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a12ba566e2c30377973350</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a12ba566e2c30377973350</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Feb 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 很多文学堂皇体面，少直面人心之作</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="413">06:53</a> 真正善良的文学艺术应展现真实凌乱世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="615">10:15</a> 我们不缺揭示人生困境能力，缺的是有所肯定的能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 写作与日常讲述应跳出定式还原真实</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1108">18:28</a> 小说添加细节凸显善恶交织，让人性更真实丰富</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1235">20:35</a> 小说中不能只有良善或冷酷，应凌厉中带暖意，</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1426">23:46</a> 生活信念是求渡力量，珍视日常平凡美好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 对笔下人物有悲悯，不忍下重手，人物会尽力弥合生活裂缝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2312">38:32</a> 《红楼梦》诗意源于日常，兼具入世与出世张力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">41:52</a> 与恶龙缠斗，终会变成恶龙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2613">43:33</a> 生活滋养源于平凡日常与文学精神养分</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3040">50:40</a> 以生命热情化解现实之恶，清醒拥抱岁月静好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3162">52:42</a> 好的文艺作品应撬开价值体系缝隙照进光</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐选取：</span><br><span>《你我经历的一刻》——zazazsu咂咂苏</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63132c2223d10ae8a17947b4/llCGhxiOmlRlWKrCdWIKb5HOxn7M.m4a" length="53075954" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:54:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnmUDzgJGvDy8Y3b8kkbRhU4mYN_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>83</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
