  <item>
    <title>80.比起深刻，我想要快乐</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/694dfb7b63a654fa60e80739</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">694dfb7b63a654fa60e80739</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 26 Dec 2025 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>此次，和热水频道主播一起聊天，关于聚会，关于做饭，关于充电，关于深刻和快乐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外，about第九本新书</span><a href="https://xhslink.com/m/312xmhJuMsj" data-url="https://xhslink.com/m/312xmhJuMsj"><span>《好久没聚会了》</span></a><span>上市了，感兴趣的朋友可以去看一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 人很难独自生活</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 纺锤体的大多数</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 大E人本身爱张罗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 继承了父母热情好客的基因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a> 厨房热火朝天，外间欢歌笑语</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> 家是我的掩体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 做饭要讲究信息差，主打一个意外之喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1740">29:00</a> 一些破冷场的套路话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 和很熟的人，聊一些不太愉快的话题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2190">36:30</a> 年龄到了这里，觉得快乐比深刻有意义</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2289">38:09</a> 我不想被哲理点亮，我只想要一个朋友温暖的拥抱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 陪伴本身就很治愈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 热闹或者安静，需要平衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3173">52:53</a> 不做无聊之事，何遣有涯之生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3499">58:19</a> 幸福非常脆弱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3750">62:30</a> 真的不害怕被遗忘吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3840">64:00</a> 和时代情绪，保持距离</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63132c2223d10ae8a17947b4/lp3FZ-9L_czGy4Y9gDE_Iy1jwvyy.m4a" length="65768835" type="audio/mp4"/>
